## Choose the right layer

| Need | Use | Boundary |
| --- | --- | --- |
| A repeated visual or interaction element | [Components](../components/index.html), such as fields, cards and tables | Reuse the canonical owner and its complete examples. |
| A supported device control | The domain specification below and the native control | Home Assistant decides capability, permission, mode and range. |
| A task across several controls | The flow specification below | Keep unsaved work, native outcomes and recovery routes. |
| Native shell, colour settings or Energy presentation | [Compatibility register](compatibility-register.html) | Only the listed exact adapters claim maintained integration. |
| A new or third-party surface | Its native interface and documented variables | Matching colours do not show that behaviour is supported. |

